<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Account Password Reset - BOM ServiceHub</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      color: #1e293b;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .wrapper {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    }

    .brand-header {
      background-color: #0f172a;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .header-title {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0;
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .brand-subtitle {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .action-banner {
      background: #4f46e5;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 28px 24px;
    }

    .credentials-box {
      background-color: #f1f5f9;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }

    .cred-item {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .cred-item:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .cred-label {
      color: #64748b;
      font-weight: 500;
      display: inline-block;
      width: 140px;
    }

    .cred-value {
      color: #0f172a;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .btn-container {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 24px 0 16px 0;
    }

    .btn {
      background: #2563eb;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: inline-block;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 15px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);
    }

    .note-box {
      background-color: #fffbeb;
      border: 1px solid #fef3c7;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #92400e;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .footer {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      padding: 16px 24px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #64748b;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="brand-header">
      <div class="header-title">
        Birla Open Minds ServiceHub
      </div>
      <div class="brand-subtitle">
        Enterprise Service & Support Management
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="action-banner">
      Account Password Reset Notice
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
      <p>Your account password has been reset by an Administrator. You can now log into the portal using your email and default temporary password below:</p>

      <div class="credentials-box">
        <div class="cred-item">
          <span class="cred-label">Login Email:</span>
          <span class="cred-value"><%= email %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="cred-item">
          <span class="cred-label">Default Password:</span>
          <span class="cred-value"><%= defaultPassword %></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="btn-container">
        <a href="<%= loginUrl %>" class="btn" target="_blank">Log In to ServiceHub Portal</a>
      </div>

      <div class="note-box">
        <strong>🔒 Security Notice:</strong> Upon your first login with this default password, you will be automatically prompted to create a new secure password of your choice.
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>This is an automated security notification. Please do not reply directly to this email.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>

</html>